_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2GnoyWU8XfwQ7kNvwFhmPef&_nc_oc=Adru-a_IY_LIsVO4pco2L4Mr1CkR7S9v5Z-TPeWwWuEcMF1qqmfI8Uw8UyebiMbdwAg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEl1Ve9s7z7jjtB2dPD21TYtvQ0sAVPQ5w1Txe_h3by5Q&oe=6A85946F"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_front_elevation.png", "id": "898712499715357", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818852_898712503048690_6138052247687145195_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=50t1sr-wz8YQ7kNvwGGEyXM&_nc_oc=AdqOJafa3tazi6gIG8eZcms8pCLb3XD7FvPWAFpnVL0h9hdGMU7SpYo6G5fauICtOww&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHAbdsPF40x14UJVmKcuU9TIjTtv5L3vcTKii9NDDkPQg&oe=6A858F0C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Pixel Blocks", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Pixel Blocks revolutionizes VR gaming by combining **intuitive voxel creation** with **seamless multiplayer collaboration**.\n\n### Core Features\n\n- **Infinite Worlds**: Explore and build in massively scalable environments\n- **Real-Time Collaboration**: Build with friends instantly with zero lag\n- **GPU-Accelerated Rendering**: Thousands of blocks without performance issues\n- **Advanced Networking**: Instant synchronization across all players\n- **Built-In Voice Chat**: Immersive team communication without breaking immersion\n\n### Perfect For\n\n- Creative gamers and artists\n- Educators and students\n- Social communities and friend groups\n- Content creators and streamers\n\nPixelBlock transforms VR into a canvas for collaborative creativity.", "short_description": "Pixel Blocks is a collaborative VR voxel-building game where players create and explore shared worlds together in real-time. Use natural hand gestures to place and paint colorful blocks, build massive structures, and collaborate with friends instantly. Featuring cross-platform multiplayer, voice chat, optimized performance, and infinite scalability. Create, 